OL,3,AGavin and Stacey star Rob Brydon's
OL,4,Aregret at turning down Dolly Parton
OL,5,Ainterview
OL,6,
OL,7,FGavin and Stacey star Rob Brydon says
OL,8,Fhe "regrets" turning down the chance to
OL,9,Finterview Dolly Parton after choosing
OL,10,Fto stay on a family holiday.
OL,12,FBrydon fronted the BBC documentary
OL,13,Fseries Honky Tonk Road Trip, where he
OL,14,Ftravelled across the American South to
OL,15,Fcelebrate 100 years of country music.
OL,17,FIn it he visited Dollywood, a theme
OL,18,Fpark created by Parton, where Dolly's
OL,19,Frelatives had traced the lineage of the
OL,20,FParton and Owens sides to Wales.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,166,160,200,105,0,100
