OL,3,AGavin and Stacey star Rob Brydon's
OL,4,Aregret at turning down Dolly Parton
OL,5,Ainterview
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe was told he could interview Parton
OL,8,Fif he returned after filming had ended,
OL,9,Fbut chose to stay on his family holiday
OL,10,Fin Arizona - an opportunity he now
OL,11,Fwished he had taken because he never
OL,12,Fgot to meet her before she died.
